### 상품 목록
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/products

### 상품 개수
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/products/count

### 상품 하나
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/products/9101

### 없는 상품
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/products/9999

### 상품 등록
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "monitor",
  "price": 250000,
  "stock": 5
}

### 상품 삭제
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/products/9103

### 없는 상품 삭제
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/products/9999

### 상품 수정
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/products/9101
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "keyboard-pro",
  "price": 35000,
  "stock": 8
}

### 없는 상품 수정
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/products/9999
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "nothing",
  "price": 1000,
  "stock": 1
}

### 카테고리 목록
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/categories

