GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/categories/1

### 없는 카테고리
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/categories/99

### 카테고리 등록
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/categories
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "food"
}

